{
  "info": {
    "name": "Eureka LMS — Complete Student Journey API",
    "description": "# 🎓 Eureka LMS — Student Mobile App API Collection\n\nWelcome to the complete, automated Postman test collection for **Eureka LMS (Student Experience)**.\n\n---\n\n## 🗺️ Student User Journey Overview\nThis collection takes a student from initial app installation and registration all the way to taking timed exams, submitting homework, and viewing dynamic peer ranking analytics.\n\n### ⚡ Zero-Manual-Config Automation\nEvery folder in this collection automatically extracts IDs, tokens, and response fields into collection variables:\n* `{{token}}` & `{{refreshToken}}` ➔ Generated on Register/Login\n* `{{stageId}}`, `{{gradeLevelId}}`, `{{subjectId}}`, `{{lessonId}}` ➔ Captured from Academic Discovery\n* `{{groupId}}` & `{{groupCode}}` ➔ Captured from Group Search\n* `{{homeworkId}}` & `{{examId}}` ➔ Captured from Homework/Exam feeds\n* `{{notificationId}}` ➔ Captured from Notifications feed\n\n---\n\n## 🏃 How to Run the Entire Suite\n1. Ensure MySQL and backend server are running (`npm run dev`).\n2. Click **Eureka LMS — Complete Student Journey API** in Postman.\n3. Click **Run Collection** ➔ **Run Eureka LMS**.\n4. All 28 requests will execute in sequential order with automated variable handoffs.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "resetToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "stageId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "gradeLevelId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "subjectId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "lessonId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "groupCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "groupId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "homeworkId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "examId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Step 1: Authentication & Verification",
      "description": "## 🔐 Phase 1: Authentication & Account Verification\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Register Screen` (Full name, Egyptian phone `01[0125]XXXXXXXX`, email, password)\n* `Email Verification OTP Screen` (6-digit code sent via SMTP)\n* `Login Screen` (Returns JWT access token + refresh token)\n* `Forgot Password & Reset Password Screens`\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Automatically captures `{{token}}` and `{{refreshToken}}` upon successful registration or login.\n* All subsequent requests inherit `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Register Student",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data) {",
                  "    if (res.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "    if (res.data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"أحمد محمود علي\",\n  \"email\": \"student.journey@eureka-test.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"role\": \"STUDENT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Send Verification Email",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/send-verification-email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "send-verification-email"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Verify Email OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otpCode\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "verify-email"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data) {",
                  "    if (res.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "    if (res.data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student.journey@eureka-test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 Refresh Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.6 Get Current User Profile (Me)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.7 Forgot Password (Request OTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student.journey@eureka-test.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.8 Verify Forgot Password OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.resetToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('resetToken', res.data.resetToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student.journey@eureka-test.com\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.9 Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student.journey@eureka-test.com\",\n  \"resetToken\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPassword123!\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"NewPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "reset-password"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 2: Academic Catalogue Discovery",
      "description": "## 📚 Phase 2: Academic Catalogue Discovery\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Stage & Grade Level Selector`\n* `Subject Grid Screen`\n* `Units & Lessons Syllabus Accordion`\n* `Lesson Details & Video Player Screen`\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Queries the educational hierarchy and extracts `{{stageId}}`, `{{gradeLevelId}}`, `{{subjectId}}`, and `{{lessonId}}` into Postman variables for seamless onboarding.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Get Educational Stages & Grade Levels",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('stageId', res.data[0].id);",
                  "    if (res.data[0].gradeLevels && res.data[0].gradeLevels.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('gradeLevelId', res.data[0].gradeLevels[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/academic/stages", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["academic", "stages"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Get Subjects",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('subjectId', res.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/academic/subjects?gradeLevelId={{gradeLevelId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["academic", "subjects"],
              "query": [{ "key": "gradeLevelId", "value": "{{gradeLevelId}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 Get Subject Units & Lessons",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.units && res.data.units.length > 0) {",
                  "    const firstUnit = res.data.units[0];",
                  "    if (firstUnit.lessons && firstUnit.lessons.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('lessonId', firstUnit.lessons[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/academic/subjects/{{subjectId}}/units?gradeLevelId={{gradeLevelId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["academic", "subjects", "{{subjectId}}", "units"],
              "query": [{ "key": "gradeLevelId", "value": "{{gradeLevelId}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.4 Get Lesson Details (Videos & PDFs)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/academic/lessons/{{lessonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["academic", "lessons", "{{lessonId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 3: Student Onboarding & Profile",
      "description": "## 👤 Phase 3: Student Onboarding & Profile Management\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Onboarding Wizard` (Select Stage, Grade Level, and enrolled subjects)\n* `Student Profile Screen`\n* `App Settings Screen` (Language preference `AR`/`EN`, Dark Mode, Notification toggles)\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Uses `{{stageId}}`, `{{gradeLevelId}}`, and `{{subjectId}}` collected from Step 2 to configure the student profile with zero manual typing.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 Complete Student Onboarding",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stageId\": \"{{stageId}}\",\n  \"gradeLevelId\": \"{{gradeLevelId}}\",\n  \"subjectIds\": [\"{{subjectId}}\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/students/onboarding", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["students", "onboarding"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 Get Student Full Profile",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/students/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["students", "profile"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 Update App Settings",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"appLanguage\": \"AR\",\n  \"darkMode\": true,\n  \"notifyExams\": true,\n  \"notifyHomework\": true,\n  \"notifyMessages\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/students/settings", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["students", "settings"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 4: Groups & Teacher Enrollment",
      "description": "## 👥 Phase 4: Teacher Groups & Enrollment\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Group Search & Explore Screen`\n* `Teacher Code Preview Modal` (Displays teacher name and schedule before joining)\n* `Join Group via Code / QR`\n* `My Enrolled Groups Tab`\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Searches active groups, saves `{{groupId}}` and `{{groupCode}}`, and demonstrates smart re-activation for returning students.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 Search Available Groups",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.groups && res.data.groups.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('groupId', res.data.groups[0].id);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('groupCode', res.data.groups[0].groupCode);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/groups/search?page=1&limit=10&subjectId={{subjectId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["groups", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "subjectId", "value": "{{subjectId}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 Preview Group by Code",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/groups/preview/{{groupCode}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["groups", "preview", "{{groupCode}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.3 Join Group by Code",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"groupCode\": \"{{groupCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/groups/join-by-code", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["groups", "join-by-code"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.4 Get My Enrolled Groups",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/groups/my-groups", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["groups", "my-groups"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.5 Get Group Details",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{groupId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 5: Home Dashboard Screen",
      "description": "## 🏠 Phase 5: Home Screen Dashboard\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Main Student Dashboard` (Home Feed)\n* `Next Class Countdown Banner`\n* `Today's Schedule Widget`\n* `Homework Deadlines & Upcoming Exams Carousel`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5.1 Get Home Dashboard Feed",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/home/dashboard", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["home", "dashboard"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 6: Homework Journey",
      "description": "## 📝 Phase 6: Homework Workflow\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Homework Feed Tabs` (Pending vs Completed)\n* `Take Homework Screen` (MCQ options & Essay input)\n* `Homework Scorecard & Result Screen` (Reviewed answers & Dynamic Peer Percentile)\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Automatically captures `{{homeworkId}}` from pending feed.\n* Demonstrates instant auto-grading for MCQs and Arabic essay `minWords` word-counter enforcement.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6.1 Get Homework Feed (Pending Tab)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('homeworkId', res.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/homework?status=pending",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["homework"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "pending" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6.2 Get Homework Questions for Taking (Answers Stripped)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/homework/{{homeworkId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["homework", "{{homeworkId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6.3 Submit Homework (MCQ Auto-Grading & Essay minWords)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"answers\": [\n    {\n      \"questionOrder\": 1,\n      \"selectedOption\": 0,\n      \"timeSpentSeconds\": 20\n    },\n    {\n      \"questionOrder\": 2,\n      \"essayText\": \"ينص قانون نيوتن الأول على أن الجسم الساكن يبقى ساكنا والمتحرك يستمر في حركته ما لم تؤثر عليه قوة خارجية\",\n      \"timeSpentSeconds\": 45\n    }\n  ],\n  \"timeAnalytics\": {\n    \"averageTimePerQuestionSec\": 32,\n    \"fastestQuestionSec\": 20,\n    \"slowestQuestionSec\": 45\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/homework/{{homeworkId}}/submit", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["homework", "{{homeworkId}}", "submit"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6.4 Get Homework Result Scorecard & Peer Percentile",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/homework/{{homeworkId}}/result", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["homework", "{{homeworkId}}", "result"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step 7: Exams & Timed Quizzes",
      "description": "## ⏱️ Phase 7: Timed Exams & Live Sessions\n\n### 📱 Mobile UI Screens Covered:\n* `Exams Feed` (Available, Upcoming, Completed)\n* `Exam Instructions & 4-Color Palette Screen` (🟢 Answered, 🔵 Review, 🔴 Unanswered, ⚪ Not Visited)\n* `Live Exam Session` (Server-time window enforced)\n* `Exam Report Card Screen` (Pass/Fail metrics, speed stats, reviewed questions)\n\n### ⚙️ Automation Highlights:\n* Captures `{{examId}}` and enforces server-time start window checks (ignoring client device clock drift).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "7.1 Get Exams Feed (Available / Upcoming)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('examId', res.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/exams?tab=all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["exams"],
              "query": [{ "key": "tab", "value": "all" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7.2 Get Exam Instructions & 4-Color Palette Legend",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
